          <![CDATA[Moisture-sensitive component storage and baking]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <attribute name="Description" id="1396" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Handling moisture-sensitive electronic component reels in stores: moisture barrier bag and humidity indicator card checks, MSL labels, dry cabinet storage with humidity alarms (inhibitor arcs), issue to the line with floor-life exposure counted in blocks, return to the dry cabinet where short exposures are recovered (reset arc), expiry and low-temperature baking that restores the floor life, a limit of two bakes before scrap, and reordering when the reel runs empty.]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
